{"des":"冰原猎人的烦恼-达霍格斯互动","script":"s_5_4_1","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这么快就搞定了？不愧是专业的契约者，效率真高！[l][cm]","charaName":"冰原猎人达霍格斯"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嘿嘿，几只芙洛波对我们构不成威胁的啦。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]能帮助你们是我们的荣幸啦，如果还有需要帮忙的话可以跟我们说哦。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哈哈，要是我们能和你们一样强大就好了……不过要真有你们这般实力，又何必在驻扎点打工呢，当个逍遥快活的契约者岂不更好。[l][cm]","charaName":"冰原猎人达霍格斯"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]接下来的事情应该是重建营地，加强防御……然后过段时间又被那群芙洛波毁掉，就这样循环往复……[l][cm]","charaName":"冰原猎人达霍格斯"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]难道没有办法提前预防吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我们也想提前防范，但那些家伙总是神出鬼没。通常等我们发现地面隆起的土堆，意识到它们靠近时，就已经为时已晚。[l][cm]","charaName":"冰原猎人达霍格斯"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你们不能在高处观察它们吗？比如在高地上扎营之类的？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这附近也没有合适的高点啊。而且如果在地势的地方扎营，万一夜里要是刮个大风暴雪什么的，我们就得被吹上天了。[l]","charaName":"冰原猎人达霍格斯"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_12","text":"在营地中央建个哨塔怎么样？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]哨塔？这倒是个好主意。要是那群芙洛波来了的话，我们也能第一时间得到预警……不过现在手头没有建造哨塔的材料……[l][cm]","charaName":"冰原猎人达霍格斯"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个好办，我们去准备材料，回来就给你们搭建。放心吧，{myName}可是工匠，打造出来的哨塔保证让你们满意。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nam